      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RITZA TIANA (8) stuck on well last time to finish 0.8 lengths back in second (29.88) at this track in a Grade 4 over 520m. Was a winner at her only start from this draw. Makes plenty of appeal. REBORN HOSTILITY (5) scored (29.47) last time out at this track adding to an already respectable career. Form at the trip sound including 12 wins. Solid beginner who can clear the tricky draw. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. FEDERAL SNIPER (2) won again in another strong performance after running them ragged making it six on end, scoring by 4 lengths (29.79) at this track over 520m. Has good early burn and is drawn to be prominent. Has put together a string of wins and expected to go close again.",
